#: main.cpp:118
msgid ""
"A unique name that represents this bookmark collection, usually the "
"kinstance name.\n"
"This should be \"konqueror\" for the Konqueror bookmarks, \"kfile\" for "
"KFileDialog bookmarks, etc.\n"
"The final DBus object path is /KBookmarkManager/dbusObjectName"
msgstr ""
"On seu no ki rprezinte cisse ramexhnêye di rmåkes, sovint l' no del "
"kinstance.\n"
"Ça duvreut esse « konqueror » po les rmåkes di Konqueror, « kfile » po "
"les rmåkes di KDvizeFitchî, evnd.\n"
"Li finå tchmin di l' objet DBus est /KBookmarkManager/dbusObjectName"

#: main.cpp:121
msgid "File to edit"
msgstr "Fitchî a candjî"

